    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎯 Workflow Overview: Nova AI Voice Assistant\n\n**Purpose**: This workflow creates an intelligent voice/text assistant that can handle business operations with a unique personality.\n\n## 📋 Process Steps:\n\n1. **Input Reception** → Webhook receives voice notes or text messages\n2. **Input Processing** → Switch node determines if input is audio or text\n3. **Voice Transcription** → Audio messages are converted to text using OpenAI Whisper\n4. **AI Processing** → Multi-tool AI Agent processes requests with access to:\n   - Email management (Gmail)\n   - Calendar scheduling (Google Calendar)\n   - Contact management (Airtable)\n   - Web search capabilities (SerpAPI, Wikipedia)\n   - File access (Google Drive)\n   - Company data (Google Sheets)\n   - Calculations and Hacker News\n5. **Memory Context** → Maintains conversation history within sessions\n6. **Personality Layer** → Adds Nova's unique sassy, glamorous personality\n7. **Response Delivery** → Sends formatted response back via webhook\n\n## 🎭 Nova's Character:\n- Brutally glamorous AI assistant\n- High-fashion energy with savage wit\n- Professional yet entertainingly sarcastic\n- Think: Miranda Priestly meets AI technology\n\n## 🔧 Configuration Required:\n1. Set up all API credentials (OpenAI, Google, Airtable, etc.)\n2. Configure webhook URL for your chat platform\n3. Customize Nova's personality prompt if desired\n4. Set appropriate permissions for all connected services",
        "height": 941,
        "width": 713,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "6460fe7d-2bb2-4ced-b606-c54f7b0abe43",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -880,
        864
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎤 Voice Processing\n\n**Transcribe a Recording Node**\n\nThis node uses OpenAI's Whisper model to:\n- Convert voice notes to text\n- Support multiple languages\n- Handle various audio formats\n\n**Configuration**:\n- Requires OpenAI API credentials\n- Automatically detects language\n- High accuracy transcription\n\n💡 **Business Use**: Enables hands-free interaction with the assistant, perfect for busy professionals or field workers.",
