    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🤖 AI Agent Configuration\n\n**Nova AI Agent - Core Intelligence**\n\nThis is the brain of the operation:\n- Processes natural language requests\n- Determines which tools to use\n- Orchestrates complex multi-step tasks\n- Maintains conversation context\n\n**Connected Capabilities**:\n✓ Email management\n✓ Calendar operations  \n✓ Contact database\n✓ Web search\n✓ File access\n✓ Calculations\n\n**System Prompt**:\nConfigured to be helpful, friendly, and professional while handling various business tasks intelligently.",
